xbrli:xbrl.ind-as:ExplanationOfWhetherEntityApplies:
In accordance with paragraph 25 of 
Indian Accounting Standard (Ind AS) 24 – Related Party Disclosures, the Company 
is exempted from providing disclosures pertaining to transactions with its 
subsidiary companies and joint venture entities, as these entities are 
state-controlled enterprises where the ownership by the Central and/or State 
Government, directly or indirectly, exceeds 50% of the voting rights.
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
